      "blurb": "Batarian criminal operative commanding a slaving crew",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Batarian slavers operate throughout the Terminus Systems and occasionally beyond, running operations that target isolated colonies and established trafficking routes. They are experienced in coordinating small groups under fire-necessary when your workforce actively tries to escape and the competition shoots first. Most have military backgrounds that predate their criminal careers, and it shows in how they handle armed resistance.</p><p><strong>Four-Eyed:</strong> +2 circ. bonus to Perception checks vs. hidden or undetected creatures.</p><p><strong>Tactical Command (free action, 1/round):</strong> One ally within 30 ft can use the Strike action as a free action on its next turn.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 50 Shield HP. Recharges 15 HP per turn.</p>",
